WEBVTT

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.619
POPPY: Once upon a time...

00:00:54.663 --> 00:00:57.883
in a happy forest,
in the happiest tree...

00:00:57.927 --> 00:01:00.930
lived the happiest creatures
the world has ever known.

00:01:00.973 --> 00:01:01.974
The Trolls.

00:01:02.018 --> 00:01:03.759
[BOTH SPEAKING GIBBERISH]

00:01:03.802 --> 00:01:05.413
They loved nothing more

00:01:05.456 --> 00:01:08.111
than to sing,
and dance, and hug.

00:01:08.155 --> 00:01:10.766
Dance, and hug,
and sing, and dance,

00:01:10.809 --> 00:01:12.202
and sing, and hug,
and dance...

00:01:12.246 --> 00:01:13.116
and hug, and dance,
and sing, and hug,

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.117
and dance, and hug...

00:01:14.161 --> 00:01:15.336
[CRYING]

00:01:16.337 --> 00:01:17.903
But then one day,

00:01:17.947 --> 00:01:19.601
the Trolls
were discovered by...

00:01:19.644 --> 00:01:21.385
a Bergen!

00:01:21.429 --> 00:01:22.821
[GRUNTS]

00:01:22.865 --> 00:01:24.301
The Bergens
didn't know how to sing...

00:01:24.345 --> 00:01:26.129
[SINGING OFF-KEY] or dance...

00:01:26.173 --> 00:01:28.131
or even hug.

00:01:28.175 --> 00:01:30.786
They were the most
miserable creatures
in all the land.

00:01:30.829 --> 00:01:32.396
[CLOUD SIGHS]

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.268
And once they saw
how happy the Trolls were...

00:01:34.311 --> 00:01:37.009
they wanted some of that
happiness for themselves.

00:01:37.053 --> 00:01:38.141
[SINGING]

00:01:38.185 --> 00:01:39.142
[SCREAMS]

00:01:40.012 --> 00:01:42.232
[ALL GASP]Oh, my God!

00:01:42.276 --> 00:01:45.148
Eating a Troll
made them feel so happy...

00:01:45.192 --> 00:01:47.237
they started a tradition.

00:01:47.281 --> 00:01:49.457
Once a year, every year...

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.981
the Bergens would gather
around the Troll Tree...

00:01:52.024 --> 00:01:54.026
to taste happiness...

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:57.160
on a holiday they called...

00:01:57.204 --> 00:01:58.335
Trollstice.

00:02:01.338 --> 00:02:03.340
[HIP-HOP MUSIC PLAYING][PANTING]

00:02:06.343 --> 00:02:08.084
[GRUNTING]

00:02:09.085 --> 00:02:10.478
[SNORING]

00:02:13.829 --> 00:02:14.873
Whoo!

00:02:14.917 --> 00:02:16.005
[BOTH GRUNT]

00:02:16.048 --> 00:02:17.702
Good morning, Daddy!

00:02:18.399 --> 00:02:19.530
Daddy, wake up!

00:02:19.574 --> 00:02:22.359
Daddy, wake up!
Wake up! Wake up, Daddy!

00:02:23.186 --> 00:02:25.493
Wake up, Daddy.

00:02:25.536 --> 00:02:27.843
Daddy! Daddy!
Daddy! Daddy!

00:02:27.886 --> 00:02:29.018
Daddy, wake up!

00:02:29.061 --> 00:02:30.324
[SCREAMS]

00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:32.674
Gristle! What time is it?

00:02:32.717 --> 00:02:36.286
It's Trollstice!

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:40.203
Trollstice!
Our one day to be happy.

00:02:40.247 --> 00:02:41.291
Yeah!

00:02:41.335 --> 00:02:43.728
ALL: [CHANTING]
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:47.167
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

00:02:52.694 --> 00:02:55.349
CHEF: Please give it up for
your Keeper of the Trolls...

00:02:55.392 --> 00:02:57.655
your Minister of Happiness...

00:02:57.699 --> 00:02:59.135
your Royal Chef...

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.224
Me.

00:03:02.399 --> 00:03:03.400
ALL: Ooh!

00:03:06.098 --> 00:03:07.187
[ALL GASPING]

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:09.537
[ALL CHEERING]

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.540
This is
a very special Trollstice...

00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:16.326
as there is one amongst us
who has never tasted a Troll.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:18.850
Ooh, me!
She is talking about me!

00:03:18.894 --> 00:03:20.765
Prince Gristle...[GASPS]

00:03:20.809 --> 00:03:22.724
...the time has come.

00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:23.942
It's okay, son.

00:03:23.986 --> 00:03:27.381
I remember being nervous
my first time.

00:03:27.424 --> 00:03:28.686
Okay.

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.732
That's my boy.

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.563
CHEF: It is my sacred duty...

00:03:35.606 --> 00:03:39.393
to initiate you
in the ways
of true happiness.

00:03:42.613 --> 00:03:46.574
I have chosen
an extra-special Troll,
just for you.

00:03:46.617 --> 00:03:48.271
[GASPS]

00:03:48.315 --> 00:03:51.143
The happiest,
the most positive...

00:03:51.187 --> 00:03:52.971
sweetest Troll of all.

00:03:53.015 --> 00:03:55.974
And because every prince
deserves a princess...

00:03:56.018 --> 00:04:00.631
I give you the one
they call Princess Poppy.

00:04:00.675 --> 00:04:02.677
Please make me happy,
Princess Poppy.

00:04:03.852 --> 00:04:04.940
What are you feeling?

00:04:06.681 --> 00:04:08.987
[SPITS] That one's rotten!

00:04:10.815 --> 00:04:12.295
It's fake?

00:04:12.339 --> 00:04:14.297
Fake?Fake?

00:04:14.341 --> 00:04:15.298
[GRUNTS]

00:04:16.212 --> 00:04:17.648
They're gone?

00:04:17.692 --> 00:04:19.563
Where are they?

00:04:19.607 --> 00:04:21.870
Don't worry, sire.
We'll find them.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.177
I think I hear something!

00:04:26.875 --> 00:04:28.920
KING PEPPY: Go! Go!

00:04:28.964 --> 00:04:30.400
MALE TROLL 1: We got Poppy!

00:04:30.444 --> 00:04:31.488
MALE TROLL 2:
Pass her to me!Here comes Poppy!

00:04:31.532 --> 00:04:33.098
Here she is!

00:04:33.142 --> 00:04:34.970
Ah! There's my princess.

00:04:35.013 --> 00:04:36.450
Da-da. [LAUGHS]

00:04:36.493 --> 00:04:39.104
King Peppy, some of the others
can't keep up.

00:04:39.148 --> 00:04:41.498
No Troll left behind!

00:04:44.196 --> 00:04:46.111
Thank you, King Peppy!

00:04:46.155 --> 00:04:47.983
COOKIE: Thank you,
King Peppy!MALE TROLL 3: Thank you!

00:04:48.026 --> 00:04:49.245
[GRUNTS]

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:50.464
Thank you, King Peppy.

00:04:50.507 --> 00:04:53.858
No Troll left behind!

00:04:53.902 --> 00:04:55.860
[BOTH SCREAM]

00:04:56.731 --> 00:04:58.341
Daddy, where are they?

00:04:58.385 --> 00:05:01.605
Don't just stand there!
Make my son happy!

00:05:01.649 --> 00:05:03.694
He will be happy!

00:05:03.738 --> 00:05:05.174
[ALL YELPING]

00:05:06.915 --> 00:05:07.916
[GRUNTS]

00:05:12.399 --> 00:05:15.663
[YELLS]

00:05:19.188 --> 00:05:21.277
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:05:25.281 --> 00:05:26.500
MALE TROLL: Where is he?

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.681
I don't think
King Peppy made it.

00:05:33.724 --> 00:05:35.291
[ALL GASPING]

00:05:36.727 --> 00:05:41.036
KING PEPPY: When I say
no Troll left behind...

00:05:42.254 --> 00:05:47.172
I mean,
no Troll left behind!

00:05:47.216 --> 00:05:48.260
[ALL CHEERING]

00:05:49.871 --> 00:05:52.700
King Peppy,
where's Princess Poppy?

00:05:52.743 --> 00:05:55.006
Don't worry. She's safe.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.487
No Troll left behind!

00:05:57.531 --> 00:05:58.923
ALL: Aww!

00:05:58.967 --> 00:06:00.055
But we'll be a lot safer

00:06:00.098 --> 00:06:01.230
the further we get
from Bergen Town.

00:06:01.273 --> 00:06:03.232
Go, go! Hurry!

00:06:04.755 --> 00:06:07.541
KING GRISTLE SR.:
That's right! Take her away!

00:06:07.584 --> 00:06:09.369
Get her out of my sight!

00:06:09.412 --> 00:06:14.722
She is hereby banished
from Bergen Town forever.

00:06:14.765 --> 00:06:17.028
We can all be happy again.

00:06:17.072 --> 00:06:18.943
I'll find the Trolls!

00:06:20.728 --> 00:06:24.775
And shove them down
your ungrateful throats.

